---
import AgentPage from '../../components/home/AgentPage.astro';
---
<AgentPage
  name="Pi"
  logo="/assets/agents/pi.svg"
  headline="Pi, one per task."
  sub="Ouijit runs Pi in a worktree per task, shows when each one is thinking, and teaches it the ouijit command so it can drive the board."
  description="Run Pi in parallel with Ouijit: a git worktree and terminal per task, live status through a Pi extension, and the ouijit CLI in its system prompt."
  points={[
    [
      'Knows Ouijit',
      'The ouijit CLI reference is appended to the system prompt at launch, so Pi can create tasks, move cards and stage review comments without being told how.',
    ],
    [
      'Live status',
      'Pi exposes its lifecycle to extensions, so Ouijit installs a small one and loads it at launch. It reports when a turn starts and ends, and the card shows thinking or ready.',
    ],
    [
      'Sandboxed',
      "Run it with its permission prompts off inside Ouijit's sandbox and the kernel holds it to the task's worktree. The base profile lets Pi sign in and run.",
    ],
  ]}
  startHook="pi"
  faqs={[
    [
      'Do I need to configure anything?',
      'No. Run pi in any Ouijit terminal. The extension and the CLI reference are loaded per launch and live in your config directory, where Ouijit recreates them if removed. Outside Ouijit’s terminals, Pi is untouched.',
    ],
  ]}
/>
